WEBVTT

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:10.590
<b>Wiping off my tears.</b>

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.300
<b>I'm starting to run now</b>

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:18.560
<b>Tomorrow I'll be born anew.</b>

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:24.370
<b>How could "you always be my friend"?</b>

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:29.280
<b>That person's word makes me more courageous.</b>

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:33.480
<b>There are times when it's possible I will be depressed</b>

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:38.580
<b>and there are times when things are delightful.</b>

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:45.170
<b>I'll always be</b>

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:51.020
<b>next to you.</b>

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:55.910
<b>Smiling 100%</b>

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:59.450
<b>Striking 100%</b>

00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:03.640
<b>I've come so far.</b>

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:06.560
<b>Being 100% pure</b>

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:10.190
<b>The things I want to tell you</b>

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:14.670
<b>change to treasure completely.</b>

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:17.190
<b>in the 100% case</b>

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:20.950
<b>Even if it's a long distance,</b>

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:27.280
<b>I'll still say I would meet you with the same feelings.</b>

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:42.050
<b>That code does seem like something Dan-sensei would make.</b>

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:44.130
<b>Can you decode it, Kazuma?</b>

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:47.180
<b>There’s no code I can’t solve.</b>

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:50.390
<b>This is a free-mason code!</b>

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:52.390
<b>Free-mason?</b>

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:57.350
<b>A secret society that’s said to have millions of members worldwide.</b>

00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:01.530
<b>Free-mason codes have a basic chart.</b>

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:04.190
<b>See, this is it.</b>

00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:09.950
<b>Put the 9 symbols Dan-sensei left into the chart, and...</b>

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:18.290
<b>DD SUNRISE?</b>

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:19.420
<b>That’s the—</b>

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:22.130
<b>That’s a ship that DDS owns!</b>

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:23.590
<b>The one we used when we went to Kirisaki Island.</b>

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:27.630
<b>But why did Dan-sensei write that name down?</b>

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:33.310
<b>Could Dan-sense: have been put on that ship?</b>

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:40.610
<b>Detectives of the Future!</b>

00:02:57.600 --> 00:02:59.080
<b>I'm terribly sorry.</b>

00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:01.920
<b>Please stay in this room for awhile.</b>

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:04.380
<b>Where am I?</b>

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:06.970
<b>You've figured it out already, haven’t you?</b>

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:30.860
<b>The DD Sunrise...</b>

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:31.950
<b>is leaving!</b>

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:43.880
<b>Dammit!</b>

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:45.500
<b>Huh?</b>

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:49.630
<b>Hongou, what—</b>

00:03:54.410 --> 00:03:55.850
<b>What are you going to do?</b>

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:58.220
<b>Do you trust me?</b>

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:10.740
<b>Hey, wait!</b>

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:11.420
<b>Are you serious?</b>

00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:33.900
<b>Were alive.</b>

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:37.510
<b>This isn’t enough to kill me.</b>

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:42.390
<b>Let’s go.</b>

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:43.560
<b>Right!</b>

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:02.790
<b>It’s a pleasure to meet you.</b>

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:05.330
<b>I am Anubis.</b>

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:07.340
<b>A pleasure, indeed.</b>

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:10.000
<b>What do you intend to do with me?</b>

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:15.010
<b>There must be some reason you dragged me
all the way here instead of killing me.</b>

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:20.770
<b>I have a high opinion of the organization you made, DDS.</b>

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:29.860
<b>If it weren’t for you and it, Pluto would never
have become as large and beautiful as it is.</b>

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:32.070
<b>Light and Dark.</b>

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:35.450
<b>When there is light, the dark becomes that much deeper.</b>

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:39.660
<b>And when there is dark, the light shines that much brighter.</b>

00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:45.750
<b>If it weren’t for you, the world would shine far more beautifully.</b>

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:48.540
Intruders on board!

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:51.340
Security, find and capture them!

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:52.420
Repeat!

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:54.550
Intruders on board!

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:57.180
Security, find and capture them!

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:57.280
<b>To think they've found us already.</b>

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:00.220
<b>Truly impressive students.</b>

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:06.190
<b>As long as they give me hope, I will never give in to you.</b>

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:14.610
<b>How long will you be able to keep saying that nonsense, I wonder.</b>

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:27.870
<b>Over there!</b>

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:28.670
<b>There they are!</b>

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:31.250
<b>Get them!</b>

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:34.260
<b>Oh, no!</b>

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:40.720
<b>What's wrong?</b>

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:43.060
<b>We're surrounded!</b>

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:43.890
<b>Dammit!</b>

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:45.100
<b>We have to fight!</b>

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:46.060
<b>No way!</b>

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:46.770
<b>Wait!</b>

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:49.730
<b>This ventilation shaft leads inside the ship.</b>

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:53.150
<b>The last time we rode this ship I saw the diagram. I remember it.</b>

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:55.990
<b>Alright, I'll lead them away.</b>

00:07:02.430 --> 00:07:03.410
<b>OK, let's go!</b>

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:15.000
<b>We have to hurry.</b>

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:17.050
<b>Let’s spit into two and look.</b>

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:20.680
<b>Ok then? Meg and Kazuma, you come with me.</b>

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:23.600
<b>Meg, Be careful.</b>

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.310
<b>Alright let’s go!</b>

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:40.530
<b>We'll look over there.</b>

00:08:37.150 --> 00:08:38.500
<b>Welcome Ryuu-sama.</b>

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:43.470
<b>Anubis!</b>

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:45.260
<b>There he is!</b>

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:50.180
<b>How did they find us a of a sudden?</b>

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:51.560
<b>Just run!</b>

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:01.950
<b>Hongou-sensei!</b>

00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:03.610
<b>Go!</b>

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:08.580
<b>There’s more of them!</b>

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:14.080
<b>Out of the way!</b>

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:19.460
<b>Your opponent is me, Touyama Kintarou!</b>

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:36.770
<b>The right hand of Dan Moritiko, Nanami Koutarou, is here!</b>

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:38.980
<b>You’re late, Nanami!</b>

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:44.300
<b>What are , doing?</b>

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:46.530
<b>We can’t lose to the Q-Class!</b>

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:49.490
<b>Umm, what should I do?</b>

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:56.870
<b>Thanks.</b>

00:09:58.520 --> 00:09:59.380
<b>Tie 'em up!</b>

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:03.630
<b>Where is Dan-sensei?</b>

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:07.260
<b>Come back to us.</b>

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:11.100
<b>You’re saying if I do, you'll tell me where he is?</b>

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:13.140
<b>Of course.</b>

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.690
<b>Is this an order from King Hades?</b>

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:20.020
<b>No, he doesn’t know.</b>

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.440
<b>What are you planning, Anubis?</b>

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:29.070
<b>Just bringing me back won’t atone for your failure.</b>

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:31.370
<b>What are you going to do with Dan-sensei?</b>

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:34.660
<b>Impressive indeed, Ryuu-sama.</b>

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:37.540
<b>I see that I can’t deceive you.</b>

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:42.460
<b>I will mind control Dan Morihiko.</b>

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:45.920
<b>Mind control?</b>

00:10:46.820 --> 00:10:50.680
<b>If I can mind control the leader of DDS, who is a threat to us,</b>

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:55.430
<b>and who has the absolute trust of the police,</b>

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:59.150
<b>it'll be the same as us having every bit of information there is.</b>

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:04.530
<b>And King Hades should forgive my failure.</b>

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:05.940
<b>You bastard...</b>

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:10.110
<b>This is the final battle between you and me.</b>

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:18.540
<b>If I lose here, I will have no choice left for me but death.</b>

00:11:19.020 --> 00:11:20.040
<b>Anubis...</b>

00:11:20.690 --> 00:11:26.460
<b>I've found something so important that it means that I must defy my fate.</b>

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:30.970
<b>How long will you be able to keep up that pride I wonder.</b>

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:35.560
A self-destruct mechanism has been activated.

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:38.350
10 minutes until  explosion.

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:40.980
Everyone please evacuate.

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:42.360
<b>Anubis!</b>

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:44.820
<b>Think it over, Ryuu-sama.</b>

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:46.980
<b>I'll be upstairs.</b>

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:03.130
10 minutes until explosion.

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:05.040
Everyone please evacuate.

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:07.260
<b>10 minutes?</b>

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:09.300
10 minutes until explosion.

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:09.090
<b>Dan-sense!</b>

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:10.570
<b>Oh no!</b>

00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:11.550
Everyone evacuate.

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:13.890
<b>Let’s look for him too.</b>

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:14.760
<b>Right!</b>

00:12:24.920 --> 00:12:26.020
<b>What’s going on?</b>

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:27.230
<b>Just go upstairs!</b>

00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:37.540
<b>Sensei... Dan-sensei, are you there?</b>

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:41.460
<b>Kyuu-kun!</b>

00:12:42.310 --> 00:12:43.580
<b>Katagiri-sensei!</b>

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:46.960
<b>Hey,.can you really find him with this?</b>

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:48.710
<b>Don’t worry.</b>

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:52.180
<b>If we can see which doors on board are locked,</b>

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:54.090
<b>he should be there.</b>

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:55.760
<b>Dammit.</b>

00:12:55.780 --> 00:12:57.010
<b>Aren’t you done yet?</b>

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:58.970
<b>Don’t rush me!</b>

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.220
<b>Alright, there it is!</b>

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:01.230
<b>Where is he?</b>

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:03.640
<b>B1, Room 3.</b>

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:04.350
<b>Alright, lets go!</b>

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:15.070
<b>It’s open.</b>

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:24.920
<b>Sensei...</b>

00:13:24.940 --> 00:13:26.000
<b>Dan sense!</b>

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:29.500
<b>Let’s go!</b>

00:13:37.740 --> 00:13:38.720
<b>Dan sensei!</b>

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:39.390
<b>It’s me!</b>

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:40.310
<b>Kyuu!</b>

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:45.560
<b>What have you done to Dan-sense?</b>

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:48.650
<b>Who are you?</b>

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:49.360
<b>What?</b>

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:04.210
<b>How could you tell, Kid?</b>

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:10.590
<b>Because of what you said when we apprehended those guys at the warehouse!</b>

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:16.680
<b>It’s just that the first time I saw you at DDS you
didn’t seem impressive and I was worried,</b>

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:18.680
<b>but you've really gotten good.</b>

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:22.600
<b>The real Katagiri-sensei wouldn’t say that.</b>

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:29.060
<b>She was the one who invited us to DDS to begin with</b>

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:31.070
<b>I see...</b>

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:35.150
<b>What do you intend to do with Dan-sensei?</b>

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:37.070
<b>Who knows?</b>

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:41.620
<b>This plan isn’t from the organization.</b>

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:45.710
<b>I ain’t getting caught up in it!</b>

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:48.710
<b>You're all going to die here.</b>

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:50.080
<b>That won’t be happening.</b>

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:54.840
<b>You're...</b>

00:14:55.530 --> 00:14:59.640
<b>Did you think I could be hypnotized so easily?</b>

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:02.720
<b>I won’t show you any mercy.</b>

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:06.060
<b>You're going to talk for us nice and slowly.</b>

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:08.770
<b>Talk!</b>

00:15:15.050 --> 00:15:15.820
<b>Who's there?</b>

00:15:20.510 --> 00:15:23.660
<b>To be so foolish as think that only you'd survive. .</b>

00:15:26.890 --> 00:15:30.500
<b>Dan-sensei came here to save me.</b>

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:32.540
<b>So he let himself get caught deliberately.</b>

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.050
<b>It’s no good.</b>

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:37.840
<b>There are no other locked doors on board.</b>

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:39.840
5 minutes until explosion.

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:39.180
<b>What do you mean?</b>

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:43.050
<b>Probably it’s not controlled by the ship’s computers.</b>

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:43.350
Everyone please evacuate.

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:45.810
<b>Dammit, we've just gotta look.</b>

00:15:43.910 --> 00:15:45.970
5 minutes until  explosion.

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:47.890
<b>Kyuu.</b>

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.270
Everyone please evacuate.

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:49.890
<b>Dan-sensei.</b>

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:53.770
<b>But I’m impressed you made it here.</b>

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:58.820
<b>It was because you left me this message.</b>

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:09.460
<b>Umm... I’m not sure this is the right time,</b>

00:16:09.810 --> 00:16:12.460
<b>but you know the person in that photo don’t you?</b>

00:16:13.650 --> 00:16:14.630
<b>Tell me who he is!</b>

00:16:15.230 --> 00:16:20.590
<b>He was the detective who saved me when I was young!</b>

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:30.810
<b>Kyuu!</b>

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:31.730
<b>Are you safe?</b>

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:33.940
<b>It’s fine now.</b>

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:35.940
<b>Mister, why?</b>

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:41.450
<b>You beat them all yourself?</b>

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:44.160
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:51.040
<b>That was so cool!</b>

00:16:51.850 --> 00:16:55.080
<b>That time I thought that I wanted to be like him,</b>

00:16:56.020 --> 00:16:57.710
<b>and he gave me this...</b>

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:59.710
<b>This is my treasure.</b>

00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:02.130
<b>Can I see it?</b>

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:08.510
<b>Name: Renjou Akatsuki</b>

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:10.770
<b>Sensei...</b>

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:14.520
<b>He was my assistant.</b>

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:18.360
<b>Unfortunately he’s no longer in this world,</b>

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:23.820
<b>but he was the person I trusted and relied on more than anybody.</b>

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:26.280
<b>Then he was...</b>

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:34.670
<b>Kyuu-kun, ever since I first met you I felt a nostalgic scent about you.</b>

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:38.210
<b>Now at last I understand why.</b>

00:17:48.370 --> 00:17:49.220
<b>Then...</b>

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:52.850
<b>That old man was my...</b>

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:58.270
<b>Kyuu...</b>

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:04.320
<b>Darling... please protect Kyuu.</b>

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:12.120
<b>Sensei, I'll never give up.</b>

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:15.210
<b>If I do my dad will get mad at me!</b>

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:18.330
<b>Somebody?</b>

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:20.380
<b>Can’t anybody hear me?</b>

00:18:20.980 --> 00:18:25.170
<b>Meg, Kazuma, Kinta, Ryuu!</b>

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:37.900
<b>Ryuu!</b>

00:18:38.460 --> 00:18:39.190
<b>Ryuu!</b>

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:40.270
<b>Kyuu.</b>

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:44.030
<b>Ryuu-kun!</b>

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:45.650
<b>What are you doing?</b>

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:47.660
<b>Kyuu’s...</b>

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:49.700
<b>Did you hear Kyuu!</b>

00:18:49.970 --> 00:18:51.870
<b>He’s not here!</b>

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:53.490
<b>We’re,out of time!</b>

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:57.210
<b>Hey, Ryuu-kun!</b>

00:18:57.480 --> 00:18:58.120
<b>Ryuu!</b>

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:01.460
<b>He has to be with Dan-sensei!</b>

00:19:02.150 --> 00:19:07.010
3 minutes until explosion.

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:10.340
<b>Kyuu!</b>

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:13.510
<b>There!</b>

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:15.850
<b>Kyuu!</b>

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:16.600
<b>Are you there?</b>

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:17.310
<b>Kyuu!</b>

00:19:18.710 --> 00:19:19.690
<b>Meg!</b>

00:19:19.710 --> 00:19:20.350
