00:22:55.510 --> 00:22:56.650
<b>Dan-sensei!</b>

00:22:57.010 --> 00:22:58.360
<b>No, you're fine as you are.</b>

00:23:00.050 --> 00:23:02.870
<b>You saved me the other day.</b>

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:04.660
<b>Thank you, really.</b>

00:23:05.020 --> 00:23:05.910
<b>Not at all.</b>

00:23:06.350 --> 00:23:12.630
<b>I had intended to have you rest after this, but
we just got a request for help from the police.</b>

00:23:13.570 --> 00:23:15.590
<b>Of course, if you're too tired...</b>

00:23:15.610 --> 00:23:16.840
<b>Let us go!</b>

00:23:19.070 --> 00:23:20.510
<b>I just called up the data.</b>

00:23:20.830 --> 00:23:22.510
<b>I’m all fired up!</b>

00:23:22.910 --> 00:23:25.350
<b>I'll memorize that information.</b>

00:23:25.790 --> 00:23:29.100
<b>Then let’s think about this crime, Kyuu!</b>

00:23:29.460 --> 00:23:30.150
<b>Alright!</b>

00:23:34.760 --> 00:23:37.110
<b>Well then Q-Class?</b>

00:23:37.630 --> 00:23:38.320
<b>Right!</b>

00:23:41.010 --> 00:23:42.370
<b>There’s one answer!</b>

00:23:47.860 --> 00:23:51.770
<b>Somehow it's collapsing</b>

00:23:51.800 --> 00:23:54.140
<b>Embracing such a feeling.</b>

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:55.030
<b>Flowing.</b>

00:23:55.050 --> 00:23:58.910
<b>I'd be worried tomorrow.</b>

00:23:58.930 --> 00:24:01.120
<b>If the same thing happened.</b>

00:24:01.140 --> 00:24:02.120
<b>Go wrong.</b>

00:24:02.130 --> 00:24:06.460
<b>He looks up at the sky, pondering</b>

00:24:06.470 --> 00:24:09.020
<b>You're very far away.</b>

00:24:09.930 --> 00:24:13.180
<b>Show your heart if you have the courage</b>

00:24:13.190 --> 00:24:16.310
<b>passing the border line.</b>

00:24:16.330 --> 00:24:19.760
<b>In order to get past, I walk against the wind</b>

00:24:19.770 --> 00:24:23.400
<b>and I can finish a battle.</b>

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:26.940
<b>When I feel like an abandoned child</b>

00:24:26.970 --> 00:24:30.360
<b>then I'll stand in line with you.</b>

00:24:30.390 --> 00:24:33.930
<b>Facing the wind, I forget,</b>

00:24:33.940 --> 00:24:37.540
<b>somehow this is the only important thing.</b>

00:24:37.550 --> 00:24:40.290
<b>We protect, because there Is no return.</b>

00:24:40.310 --> 00:24:41.890
<b>It's becoming dearly.</b>

00:24:41.920 --> 00:24:45.840
<b>Today I embrace, right now I conquer.</b>

00:24:46.660 --> 00:24:48.850
<b>Since we entered DDS a lot has happened huh?</b>

00:24:48.870 --> 00:24:50.680
<b>Like peeping in the women’s bath and sneaking around in general</b>

00:24:50.710 --> 00:24:54.060
<b>And like getting mistaken for a molester during an investigation
and getting done in by Pro-wrestler moves!</b>

00:24:54.090 --> 00:24:55.900
<b>Then failing in lock-picking and then breaking down the door!</b>

00:24:56.420 --> 00:24:58.230
<b>Ah!! Don’t remember only those things!</b>

00:24:58.260 --> 00:25:01.450
<b>What I mean is that we've become full fledged detectives ..</b>

00:25:00.930 --> 00:25:03.450
<b>Hey, everyone it seems like there’s an important announcement!</b>

00:25:03.470 --> 00:25:04.490
<b>Ok!</b>

00:25:04.510 --> 00:25:05.950
<b>Listen to me!</b>

00:25:06.760 --> 00:25:08.740
<b>The announcement of Dan-sensei’s successor?</b>

00:25:08.930 --> 00:25:09.700
<b>What’s this?</b>

00:25:09.730 --> 00:25:11.460
<b>Just some made up article.</b>

00:25:11.480 --> 00:25:13.920
<b>But it’s got a picture of us on it...</b>

00:25:13.940 --> 00:25:15.460
<b>Is it some kind of trick?</b>

00:25:15.480 --> 00:25:17.090
<b>It's got a name!</b>

00:25:17.100 --> 00:25:18.210
<b>Where?</b>
